(5561695, 804880, 78371, '<td valign="top">The choice of cropping out most of the girl while showing the complete shadow. Everything is conveyed in that shadow, her attitude, maybe even her intentions. I think that it would have been too repetitious to show the whole girl and not as interesting of a shot.</td>', 'The choice of cropping out most of the girl while showing the complete shadow. Everything is conveyed in that shadow, her attitude, maybe even her intentions. I think that it would have been too repetitious to show the whole girl and not as interesting of a shot.', '2009-07-06 10:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
