(5561712, 804883, 78371, '<td valign="top">I love the grittiness to this photograph. The way you used texture to convey the moon is quite clever and makes for a more interesting photograph.  The dying/dead bird is post-processed well too. I do like how you added the textural shadow to ground the bird a bit. I think that the moon should be a little farther way though.</td>', 'I love the grittiness to this photograph. The way you used texture to convey the moon is quite clever and makes for a more interesting photograph.  The dying/dead bird is post-processed well too. I do like how you added the textural shadow to ground the bird a bit. I think that the moon should be a little farther way though.', '2009-07-06 11:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5561726, 804718, 78371, '<td valign="top">Lighting is kind of ho-hum. The photograph sort of has that green florescent tint to it. The design on the shoes could of made for interesting shadows.</td>', 'Lighting is kind of ho-hum. The photograph sort of has that green florescent tint to it. The design on the shoes could of made for interesting shadows.', '2009-07-06 11:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
