(5561730, 804838, 78371, '<td valign="top">I really like this photograph. I think that the lack of color showcases the longing that the woman has.  The reflection is brilliant, as well as the texture of the mirror/window.</td>', 'I really like this photograph. I think that the lack of color showcases the longing that the woman has.  The reflection is brilliant, as well as the texture of the mirror/window.', '2009-07-06 11:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
