(5575499, 804838, 30807, '<td valign="top">Boy, this is a really well-executed picture - it helps as I don''t know of the album you mention, but the image is first-rate.<br/> <br/>What patience and care went into it - if you don''t already, I would consider doing this as a living - you have it all sewn up, so far as I can see<br/> <br/>All the best for the future!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Boy, this is a really well-executed picture - it helps as I don''t know of the album you mention, but the image is first-rate. What patience and care went into it - if you don''t already, I would consider doing this as a living - you have it all sewn up, so far as I can see All the best for the future! ', '2009-07-15 19:54:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5576430, 804882, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ummmm. . .you lost all credibility about the "severely handicapped in the creativity department" thing with this one :)   WOW!  THIS IS CREATIVE GENIUS!  Even tho you got the idea from someone else, it was your creativity that pulled it off -- and it is nothing short of amazing!  Congratulations on taking the top spot with this deserving photo!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ummmm. . .you lost all credibility about the "severely handicapped in the creativity department" thing with this one :)   WOW!  THIS IS CREATIVE GENIUS!  Even tho you got the idea from someone else, it was your creativity that pulled it off -- and it is nothing short of amazing!  Congratulations on taking the top spot with this deserving photo! ', '2009-07-16 12:08:46.000000', NULL, 0),
