(5576440, 803228, 24454, '<td valign="top">Whoa! This is just phenomenal!  I truly hate what I think of as that 2nd-to-last day troll curse.  I get it too in almost every challenge.   This is just brilliant, no matter the score tho.</td>', 'Whoa! This is just phenomenal!  I truly hate what I think of as that 2nd-to-last day troll curse.  I get it too in almost every challenge.   This is just brilliant, no matter the score tho.', '2009-07-16 12:15:06.000000', NULL, 0),
